  <h2>The Four DQ Cake Options — Which Size Is Right for You?</h2>

  <h3>8-Inch Round — $22.99+ (Serves 8–10)</h3>
  <p>The <a href="/items/dq-cake-round-8inch">8-inch round</a> is the right size for household birthdays, small office treats, and celebrations where you need 8–10 portions. At $22.99+, it is the most affordable DQ Cake. If you are celebrating with more than 10 people, step up to the 10-inch.</p>

  <h3>10-Inch Round — $32.99+ (Serves 12–16)</h3>
  <p>The <a href="/items/dq-cake-round-10inch">10-inch round</a> is the most frequently ordered DQ Cake. It handles most birthday party scenarios — 12–16 portions is right for children's parties, family gatherings, and medium office celebrations. This is the size available in both classic and Blizzard Cake flavors.</p>

  <h3>Blizzard Cakes (10-Inch) — $35.99–$38.74+</h3>
  <p>Blizzard Cakes use actual Blizzard mix-ins distributed throughout the soft serve layer. Four flavors available:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard-cake">Oreo® Blizzard® Cake</a></strong> — $38.74+ — Oreo cookie pieces throughout. The #1 DQ Cake.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard-cake">Cookie Dough Blizzard® Cake</a></strong> — $35.99+ — Cookie dough chunks throughout. Second most popular.</li>
    <li><strong>Reese's® PB Cup Blizzard® Cake</strong> — $35.99+ — Reese's pieces throughout. For peanut butter fans.</li>
    <li><strong>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard® Cake</strong> — $35.99+ — Brownie pieces throughout. For deep chocolate lovers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Sheet Cake — $44.99+ (Serves 24–32)</h3>
  <p>The <a href="/items/dq-sheet-cake">Sheet Cake</a> is the large-event option. Use it for graduations, office parties of 20+, school events, and any gathering where a 10-inch would not stretch far enough. Rectangular format, available in classic DQ flavor.</p>

